                        <h4 class="side-article-title">
                            GPI Reduces Its Carbon Footprint by 18% Through Advanced
                            Manufacturing Practices
                        </h4>
                        <p class="side-article-excerpt">
                            The company continues to invest in sustainable technologies
                            in line with global environmental standards and Egypt's 2030 vision.
                        </p>
                        <a asp-controller="Pages" asp-action="NewsDetails" class="read-more-link">
                            Read More <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="side-article-item">
                    <div class="side-article-img-box">
                        <img src="~/assets/GPI Website Visuals/News/latest-news-side-3.jpg" alt="GPI Exports Expansion">
                        <div class="side-image-overlay"></div>
                        <span class="side-article-badge">Company Updates</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="side-article-text">
                        <span class="side-article-date">28 Jan 2026</span>
                        <h4 class="side-article-title">
                            GPI Exports Expand to 25 Countries Across the EMEA Region
                        </h4>
                        <p class="side-article-excerpt">
                            With continued growth, GPI now exports high-quality cables,
                            meters, and lighting products to more than 25 countries in Europe, Africa, and the
                            Middle East.
                        </p>
                        <a asp-controller="Pages" asp-action="NewsDetails" class="read-more-link">
                            Read More <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     COMPANY LIFE / INTERNSHIP SPOTLIGHT
     A photo highlight, not a press article — kept visually
     distinct from the news cards around it, with its own
     gallery + carousel rather than a "read more" link to a
     detail page (there isn't a full article for this one).
============================================================= -->
<section class="pt-0">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="about-header text-center mb-60px" style="text-align: left !important; margin-bottom: 30px !important;">
            <p class="about-label" style="font-weight: 900; color: #a3191e; margin-top:24px !important; margin-bottom:0px !important">
                Life at GPI
            </p>
            <span class="hero-small reveal-line" style="font-size: 25px; font-weight: 700; color: #06283f;">
                NURTURING TALENT &amp; BUILDING TOMORROW'S LEADERS
            </span>
        </div>

        <div class="spotlight-card">
            <div class="spotlight-media" id="ilOpen" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="View internship photo gallery">
                <img src="~/assets/images/inter1.jfif" alt="GPI Summer Internship Program 2026">
                <div class="spotlight-media-overlay"></div>
                <span class="spotlight-count-badge">
                    <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                        <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="14" rx="2" />
                        <path d="M3 13l4-4 4 4 6-6 4 4" />
                    </svg>
                    3 Photos
                </span>
                <span class="spotlight-expand">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7" /></svg>
                </span>
            </div>

            <div class="spotlight-content">
                <span class="about-label" style="font-weight: 900; color: #a3191e; margin-top:24px !important; margin-bottom:0px !important" >
                    Careers
                </span>
                <h3 class="spotlight-title" style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; color: #06283F; margin-bottom: 14px; line-height: 1.25;">
                    Summer Internship Program 2026
                </h3>
                <p class="spotlight-desc">
                    Every year, GPI welcomes a new cohort of interns across engineering, manufacturing
                    and corporate functions — pairing them with mentors on the factory floor and in the
                    field to get hands-on experience with real projects from day one.
                </p>
                <button  class="about-label" style="font-weight: 900; color: #a3191e; margin-top:24px !important; margin-bottom:0px !important"  id="ilViewBtn" type="button">
                    View Gallery <span>→</span>
                </button>
                <div class="spotlight-thumbs">
                    <img class="spotlight-thumb" data-index="1" src="~/assets/images/inter2.jfif" alt="Internship photo 2">
                    <img class="spotlight-thumb" data-index="2" src="~/assets/images/inter3.jfif" alt="Internship photo 3">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Internship gallery lightbox -->
<div class="il-lightbox" id="ilLightbox" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Internship photo gallery">
